+// MaxPool2d kernel: supports arbitrary strides, dilation, padding, ceil_mode
+// Input: x (N,C,H,W), output: y (N,C,Hout,Wout)
+// Parameters: kernel_size, stride, padding, dilation, ceil_mode (passed as ints)
